# Scacelith - العربية
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Written right to left: the UI mirrors
# its rows and aligns text to the right. Plurals have six forms:
# zero|one|two|few (3-10)|many (11-99)|other (100, 101, 102...).
# U+200F (right-to-left mark) keeps a parenthesis after a Latin word on the Arabic side.

